  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Sir_Panickee.jpg\" title=\"Sir Panickee\"><img alt=\"Sir Panickee\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"265\" src=\"/images/Sir_Panickee.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Sir_Panickee.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Sir Panickee</div></div></div>\n<p>Sir Panickee is an NPC located on Level 2 of <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>.  He is the object of the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Me_Hubby\" title=\"Find Me Hubby\">Find Me Hubby</a> given by <a href=\"/wiki/Audrey_the_Alchemist\" title=\"Audrey the Alchemist\">Audrey the Alchemist</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Sir_Panickee.27s_Quests\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Sir Panickee's Quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kog's_Army\" title=\"Kog's Army\">Kog's Army</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
